Z||000006||Phil||12-23-2000||08:41 PM|||| Load your sig. pic into PIP and click Post It then close PIP. Click on profile at the top of the page(not the one in the blue section) enter your password and stuff -put the cursor in the sig box and hit CTRL and V together. ||||reg||1
